# ReelFetch Central Android APK Download URL
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Single central configuration value: VITE_APK_DOWNLOAD_URL
#
# When configured with a valid URL (e.g., GitHub Releases, Firebase Storage,
# CDN, or a local file like /releases/ReelFetch-v1.0.0.apk):
#   - The "Download for Android" buttons across Navbar, Hero, and Download section
#     become active direct download links.
#   - Tapping or clicking instantly starts downloading the real Android APK.
#
# When empty or omitted:
#   - All download buttons are gracefully disabled.
#   - The button text changes to "Download coming soon".
#   - A friendly notification informs visitors that the APK is being prepared.
#   - No fake or placeholder URLs are ever invented or served.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_APK_DOWNLOAD_URL=
